<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="pg0" name="Regras de negócio"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="PrimeCoding - Regras de negócio" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="700" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EEF8;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="500" height="352" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="Catálogo" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="&lt;b&gt;RN01&lt;/b&gt; - A loja vende somente dois produtos: MacBook Pro 14 (M5 Pro) e Galaxy Book6 Pro 14. O administrador altera preço, estoque, fotos e descrição, mas não cadastra outro produto." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="126" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="&lt;b&gt;RN02&lt;/b&gt; - Produto com estoque zero aparece como &quot;Esgotado&quot; e o botão de pedido vira &quot;Avise-me quando chegar&quot;." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="240" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="&lt;b&gt;RN03&lt;/b&gt; - Todo produto mostra a ficha técnica completa, incluindo o layout do teclado (ABNT2) e o sistema operacional." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="334" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF0DC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="76" width="500" height="426" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="Preço e pagamento" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="&lt;b&gt;RN04&lt;/b&gt; - O preço de tabela pode ser pago em até 12x sem juros no cartão. No PIX há 10% de desconto sobre o preço de tabela." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="126" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="&lt;b&gt;RN05&lt;/b&gt; - O site não processa pagamento: o vendedor envia a chave PIX ou o link de pagamento do cartão pela conversa do WhatsApp." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="220" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v11" value="&lt;b&gt;RN06&lt;/b&gt; - O preço de cada item fica gravado no pedido no momento em que ele é criado. Mudança de preço depois não altera pedidos já feitos." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="314" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="&lt;b&gt;RN07&lt;/b&gt; - O preço do pedido é garantido por 48 horas. Sem pagamento confirmado nesse prazo, o pedido é cancelado automaticamente." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="408" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6F2EA;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="76" width="500" height="540" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="Pedido" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="&lt;b&gt;RN08&lt;/b&gt; - Para enviar o pedido é obrigatório informar nome, WhatsApp com DDD, CPF ou CNPJ, CEP e endereço completo. O e-mail é opcional." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="126" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="&lt;b&gt;RN09&lt;/b&gt; - O cliente não cria conta nem senha: é identificado pelo número de WhatsApp. Se o número já existe, os dados dele são atualizados." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="220" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="&lt;b&gt;RN10&lt;/b&gt; - Cada pedido aceita no máximo 3 unidades de cada produto." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="314" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="&lt;b&gt;RN11&lt;/b&gt; - Ao enviar, o sistema gera um código único no formato PC-AAAA-NNNN e abre o WhatsApp da loja com uma mensagem pronta: código, produtos, quantidades, forma de pagamento e total." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="388" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="&lt;b&gt;RN12&lt;/b&gt; - Todo pedido começa como &quot;Aguardando atendimento&quot; e segue a ordem: Aguardando pagamento, Pago, Enviado, Entregue. Pode ser Cancelado enquanto não for Enviado." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="502" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8F5;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="656" width="500" height="238" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="Estoque" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="656" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="&lt;b&gt;RN13&lt;/b&gt; - O estoque só é baixado quando o pagamento é confirmado (status Pago). Pedido pago que é cancelado devolve as unidades ao estoque." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="706" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="&lt;b&gt;RN14&lt;/b&gt; - Não é possível confirmar o pagamento de um pedido se não houver estoque suficiente para todos os itens." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="800" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDE9E7;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="656" width="500" height="352" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="Entrega e pós-venda" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="656" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value="&lt;b&gt;RN15&lt;/b&gt; - Frete grátis e com seguro para todo o Brasil. O envio acontece em até 2 dias úteis após a confirmação do pagamento, e o código de rastreio vai pelo WhatsApp." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="706" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v27" value="&lt;b&gt;RN16&lt;/b&gt; - A nota fiscal sai no CPF ou no CNPJ informado no pedido. Todo produto é novo, lacrado e com garantia oficial de 1 ano no Brasil." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="820" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v28" value="&lt;b&gt;RN17&lt;/b&gt; - O cliente pode desistir da compra em até 7 dias após o recebimento (art. 49 do Código de Defesa do Consumidor)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="914" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECECEC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="656" width="500" height="426" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v30" value="Segurança e atendimento" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="656" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v31" value="&lt;b&gt;RN18&lt;/b&gt; - Para consultar um pedido, o cliente informa o código e o WhatsApp usado no pedido. Os dois precisam bater." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="706" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v32" value="&lt;b&gt;RN19&lt;/b&gt; - Só administradores com login e senha acessam o painel. A senha é guardada criptografada (hash), nunca em texto puro." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="800" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v33" value="&lt;b&gt;RN20&lt;/b&gt; - Ao enviar o pedido, o cliente aceita a política de privacidade. Os dados servem só para venda, nota fiscal e entrega (LGPD)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="894" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v34" value="&lt;b&gt;RN21&lt;/b&gt; - Atendimento no WhatsApp de segunda a sexta, das 9h às 18h. Fora desse horário o site avisa que a resposta vem no próximo dia útil." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="988" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg1" name="Fluxo do pedido"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1240" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="Fluxo do pedido pelo WhatsApp (com as regras aplicadas)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="Cliente" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="1570" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="Site PrimeCoding" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="320" width="1570" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="Vendedor (WhatsApp)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="630" width="1570" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="175" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="Escolhe o notebook e clica em &quot;Pedir pelo WhatsApp&quot;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="150" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="Tem estoque?&#xa;(RN02)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="295" y="390" width="130" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="Mostra &quot;Esgotado&quot; e oferece &quot;Avise-me quando chegar&quot;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="265" y="530" width="190" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=doubleEllipse;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="550" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="Preenche nome, WhatsApp, CPF ou CNPJ, endereço e forma de pagamento (RN08, RN10)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="140" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v11" value="Dados válidos?&#xa;(RN08, RN10)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="390" width="130" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="Gera o código PC-AAAA-NNNN, grava o preço de cada item e salva como &quot;Aguardando atendimento&quot; (RN06, RN11, RN12)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="395" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="Abre o WhatsApp da loja com a mensagem pronta do pedido (RN11)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="405" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="Confere o pedido, muda para &quot;Aguardando pagamento&quot; e envia PIX ou link do cartão (RN04, RN05)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="680" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="Pagou em até 48 h?&#xa;(RN07)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="670" width="150" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="Pedido cancelado automaticamente (RN07, RN12)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="690" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=doubleEllipse;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="715" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="Estoque suficiente?&#xa;(RN14)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="885" y="850" width="140" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="Avisa o cliente pelo WhatsApp e combina devolução ou espera" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="870" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=doubleEllipse;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="895" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="Confirma o pagamento: status Pago e baixa do estoque (RN13)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="850" width="220" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="Envia em até 2 dias úteis e manda o rastreio pelo WhatsApp (RN15)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="950" width="220" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="Recebe com nota fiscal no CPF ou CNPJ e garantia de 1 ano; pode desistir em 7 dias (RN16, RN17)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="140" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=doubleEllipse;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="175" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v5" target="v6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v6" target="v7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="não" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v7" target="v8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v8" target="v9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="sim" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="v7" target="v10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="510" y="445"/><mxPoint x="510" y="190"/></Array></mxGeomet